meta {
  name: Invite links - Who joined
  type: http
  seq: 225
}

get {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/communities/nswswk8w8wso0ko8owwk8k0w/invite-links/<invite link cuid>/uses?limit=20&offset=0
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  Who joined through the invite link (#1391), newest first: member (cuid, name, username, avatar_url) and joined_at. A member who left is not in the list, and stays in the count. Offset pagination (limit, offset). Owner and admins. Token ability: invite-links:read.
}
